Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:20.86,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:20.86,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}赫瓦林斯卡 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-2 6-2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 布克沙 · 赛后演播室专访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Number 19th seed, Maja Chwalinska, Maja,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,十九号种子 赫瓦林斯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.76,EN,,0,0,0,,great to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Hello, thanks for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你好 谢谢邀请我来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:06.48,EN,,0,0,0,,One of our favorite stories on the WTA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是本赛季 WTA 上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:07.88,EN,,0,0,0,,of 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们最爱的故事之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:08.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Glad to see you healthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你健康
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:10.20,EN,,0,0,0,,glad to see you winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:10.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,也很高兴看到你赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:11.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Strong victory today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天赢得很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.16,EN,,0,0,0,,6-2 6-2.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,六比二 六比二
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:14.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Did the fast courts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:14.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,场地这么快
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:16.16,EN,,0,0,0,,do you feel they help your game?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得对你的打法有帮助吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:19.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's tough to say, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,老实说 这不太好讲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I I haven't played all of matches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没打多少比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.16,EN,,0,0,0,,since the French Open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,从法网之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:23.84,EN,,0,0,0,,because I was injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:26.36,EN,,0,0,0,,And I definitely feel like I I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:26.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我确实感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.68,EN,,0,0,0,,need some matches, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我需要多打一些比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:31.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to kind of feel my game a little bit better,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能找回一点手感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:33.04,EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah, getting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过在往回走了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.68,EN,,0,0,0,,You did very well on your first serve today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天一发打得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:36.96,EN,,0,0,0,,You won 70% of those points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,一发得分率百分之七十
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:37.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm curious what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我好奇的是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:39.04,EN,,0,0,0,,your your thought process,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的思路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.80,EN,,0,0,0,,your strategy is behind the first serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,一发背后的战术是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:42.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Is it to put pressure with getting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,是靠高成功率施压
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.56,0:00:44.16,EN,,0,0,0,,a high percentage in, or are you trying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.56,0:00:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:45.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to improve it with the pace?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:45.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,把球速提上去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:47.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Where are your sort of goals now with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:47.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在的目标是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:48.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:50.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised with the percentage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个百分比让我意外
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.20,EN,,0,0,0,,because I was I was struggling today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我今天发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:56.24,EN,,0,0,0,,with my serve, so there was no tactic really.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:56.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直不顺 根本没什么战术
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:58.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, you got it was it was a little low,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:58.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的一发进球率是低了点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:00:59.28,EN,,0,0,0,,the amount you got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:00:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,进的球数
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.56,EN,,0,0,0,,You got 50% in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,只有百分之五十
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:01.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, good. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:01.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,哦 那挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:03.36,EN,,0,0,0,,won 70% of those points,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,但那些分你赢下了七成
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:04.80,EN,,0,0,0,,which is which is quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这已经相当不错了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Not a lot of thoughts there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我当时没想那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:08.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, so it's a part of that you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 所以这一块
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,that you want to continue improving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你还想继续提高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:11.80,EN,,0,0,0,,As you mentioned the the injuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你刚提到伤病
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:13.56,EN,,0,0,0,,the summer Wimbledon, it was it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:13.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,温网那个夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.56,0:01:14.72,EN,,0,0,0,,was very tough to see it because you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.56,0:01:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,看着真的很难受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:17.32,EN,,0,0,0,,were playing such beautiful tennis in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你在巴黎打得那么漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:18.92,EN,,0,0,0,,What did the recovery look like,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:18.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,恢复那段过得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.92,0:01:19.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and were you able
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.92,0:01:19.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,来这儿之前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:21.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to get some good training before here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,有没有练得比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:24.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, recovery has been good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,恢复得还行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously, it was a process
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然也有起伏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:29.00,EN,,0,0,0,,with some ups and downs, but but yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,是个过程 不过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:29.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm I'm healthy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:29.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我现在很健康
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.92,0:01:31.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm very grateful for it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.92,0:01:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我为此很感恩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.80,0:01:34.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely very happy to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.80,0:01:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,能来这儿我真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.48,0:01:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,It was definitely a bit frustrating, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.48,0:01:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,那阵子确实有点憋屈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:40.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I had some good momentum going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:40.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我本来势头正好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:42.68,EN,,0,0,0,,on, but it's just sport, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:42.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,但体育就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:43.40,EN,,0,0,0,,You got to accept
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:43.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你得接受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.68,EN,,0,0,0,,that it's it's brutal sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,它有时候就是很残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:47.32,EN,,0,0,0,,It is difficult, but we certainly wish you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:47.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,是不容易 我们真心祝你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:49.76,EN,,0,0,0,,continued good health moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,往后一直健健康康
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.76,0:01:50.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Roland Garros,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.76,0:01:50.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,说说法网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.84,0:01:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,it was such a magnificent run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.84,0:01:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,那一路走得太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure in the middle of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我猜在那当中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:55.24,EN,,0,0,0,,it's just you're trying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:55.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你只想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:56.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to put the crazy noise away,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,把外面的喧嚣关掉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:57.84,EN,,0,0,0,,focus on the tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,专心打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:00.16,EN,,0,0,0,,After, did did life change at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,之后呢 生活变了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:01.96,EN,,0,0,0,,There must be more more eyeballs,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,肯定有更多眼睛看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:03.80,EN,,0,0,0,,more good attention on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:03.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,更多好的关注
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.80,0:02:05.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean it changed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.80,0:02:05.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 变了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:08.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely a lot of things
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:08.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实有很多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.80,EN,,0,0,0,,that I needed to adapt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,需要我去适应
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.80,0:02:11.44,EN,,0,0,0,,to and I'm still adapting, I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.80,0:02:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我现在还在适应
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:13.88,EN,,0,0,0,,but getting better here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过在慢慢变好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a lot of attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 关注多了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:18.80,EN,,0,0,0,,definitely much more than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,比以前多太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:21.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Before I mean, no one really cared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:21.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,以前 说真的 没人在意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:25.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, life is different, but in a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:25.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,生活不一样了 是好的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate everyone's support
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很感激大家的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:29.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and you know, love also.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:29.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有那些爱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:32.36,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, definitely very grateful for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 我非常感恩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,It was a wonderful cover you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你给 Vogue 拍的那期封面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:36.48,EN,,0,0,0,,did on Vogue magazine, Vogue Poland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,很棒 是波兰版 Vogue
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:37.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy that experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,那次体验你享受吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,That can be it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种场合
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:40.24,EN,,0,0,0,,can be a little nerve-wracking sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候会让人挺紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:41.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I did, people were amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:41.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很享受 大家都很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:44.52,EN,,0,0,0,,but I was definitely very stressed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:44.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我确实非常紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:46.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and I was just like, "Guys, I I don't want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:46.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就想 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:48.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to mess anything up here and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:48.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我可不想搞砸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:51.40,EN,,0,0,0,,just tell me what to do." But yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:51.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们让我做什么我就做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.24,EN,,0,0,0,,great experience and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过那次体验很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:54.80,EN,,0,0,0,,it's just it's a Vogue magazine,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,毕竟是 Vogue
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:57.00,EN,,0,0,0,,so it's a a huge huge thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:57.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,那真的是件大事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:58.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, you absolutely nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你完成得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:02:58.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:02:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:00.48,EN,,0,0,0,,As you as you move forward now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:00.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:02.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and and continue to get more matches
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,随着比赛越打越多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,under your belt, what are some of the areas
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,有哪些地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:05.56,EN,,0,0,0,,that you'd like to just continue
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:05.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,是你想继续
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:07.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to feel a little sharper in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:07.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得更利落一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:08.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean I feel like I need
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:08.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我需要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:12.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to be a little bit more precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:12.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,再精准一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:13.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Is it the correct word?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:13.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个词用得对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:15.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. With your with your all your shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,对 你所有的击球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,with my game, yeah, and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我的整体打法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:20.00,EN,,0,0,0,,girls are playing fast, so I just need
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且姑娘们球都很快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:22.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to get used to the rhythm a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:22.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得再适应一下节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:24.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and I feel like I will I will find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我会找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:27.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I believe that, but in that, but yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我相信这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:30.68,EN,,0,0,0,,so a bit more precise shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以是更精准的击球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:34.40,EN,,0,0,0,,serve and return are my definitely goals
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:34.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球和接发是我这个赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:35.92,EN,,0,0,0,,for this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,明确的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and just you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 然后就是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:39.20,EN,,0,0,0,,keep on fighting every single match
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:39.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一场都拼下去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and we'll see how the season goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,看看这个赛季能走到哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:43.20,EN,,0,0,0,,It's it's a wonderful to see you playing here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你在这儿打球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in Mason, Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,俄亥俄州的梅森
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:46.24,EN,,0,0,0,,It's a it's a very different vibe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:46.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里的氛围
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:47.72,EN,,0,0,0,,than the big cities, London,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:47.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,和伦敦巴黎那种大城市
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:50.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Paris and it's it's very family oriented,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,很不一样 特别有家庭感
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,very very homey here in Mason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,梅森这儿特别温馨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:54.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you like the Midwest vibes here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:54.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你喜欢中西部这种感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:57.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I love it. It's my first time, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢 这是我第一次来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.28,0:03:59.52,EN,,0,0,0,,But the facility is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.28,0:03:59.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这里的场馆太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I love it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我特别喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:03.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we have our own car here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们这儿还有自己的车
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:04.68,EN,,0,0,0,,We can drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:04.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,可以自己开
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:06.56,EN,,0,0,0,,We can have a good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,还能吃到好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:08.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Food is amazing, also.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:08.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,食物也特别棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:10.44,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, I love it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:10.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 我很喜欢这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:11.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Fantastic. Well, listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,太好了 那么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,you were brilliant in the opening round.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你首战打得非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:13.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Hope you continue
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:13.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望你继续
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:15.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to feel more comfortable on the court,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:15.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,在场上找到感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:16.92,EN,,0,0,0,,healthy, and come back and chat with us
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持健康 然后回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:17.44,EN,,0,0,0,,as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,像往常一样跟我们聊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:18.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it would be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的 我很乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:20.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:20.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
